": 26.942, "end": 27.242, "text": "Good."}, {"start": 28.242, "end": 28.522, "text": "Now..."}, {"start": 29.334, "end": 31.856, "text": "One thing I want to be open with you about."}, {"start": 33.037, "end": 38.622, "text": "You have used anti-inflammatory painkillers heavily and for a long time."}, {"start": 39.763, "end": 40.684, "text": "Is that harming me?"}, {"start": 41.464, "end": 45.728, "text": "It means we should monitor your blood pressure and your kidney function."}, {"start": 46.569, "end": 48.45, "text": "That is the sensible step."}, {"start": 49.171, "end": 50.172, "text": "How do we go about that?"}, {"start": 50.912, "end": 55.176, "text": "I would like you to measure your blood pressure at home over three days."}, {"start": 55.976, "end": 56.557, "text": "I can do that."}, {"start": 57.157, "end": 57.738, "text": "And the kidneys?"}, {"start": 58.518, "end": 59.318, "text": "Blood tests."}, {"start": 60.059, "end": 61.64, "text": "Please book a time for those."}, {"start": 62.5, "end": 66.042, "text": "We check kidneys, cholesterol, and blood sugar."}, {"start": 66.723, "end": 68.644, "text": "And you will still renew the Ibumetin today?"}, {"start": 69.484, "end": 69.824, "text": "Yes."}, {"start": 70.405, "end": 72.166, "text": "The prescription is created."}, {"start": 73.066, "end": 75.127, "text": "Does that plan sound workable to you?"}, {"start": 75.828, "end": 76.208, "text": "It does."}, {"start": 76.788, "end": 79.169, "text": "Home readings for three days, then the blood tests."}, {"start": 80.01, "end": 80.67, "text": "That is it."}, {"start": 81.611, "end": 83.452, "text": "Have you read anything good lately?"}, {"start": 84.172, "end": 85.733, "text": "I finished a crime novel last night."}, {"start": 86.093, "end": 87.454, "text": "It kept me up far too late."}, {"start": 88.923, "end": 90.265, "text": "The good ones tend to."}, {"start": 91.106, "end": 92.088, "text": "Take care, Jens."}, {"start": 92.729, "end": 93.049, "text": "Thanks."}, {"start": 93.329, "end": 93.65, "text": "See you."}], "machine": "gpu59.int.triton.aalto.fi", "git_commit": "735eed3a1a4f5d8bc8a3ac1f1c8897e291443b9f", "date": "2026-09-20", "timing_s": {"transcribe_and_align": 1.813}}